# 🔐 Walkthrough: Implementing "Iron Man" Authentication

**Goal:** Secure the Nucleus Marketing Dashboard so only "Stark Industries" (Garg Enterprises) can access it.
**Status:** ✅ COMPLETE

## 1. The Architecture (Iron Man Strategy)

We successfully moved from "Unsecured" (Garage Mode) to "Secured" (Street Legal).

*   **The Engine:** [server.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/nucleus/mcp_server/server.py) (Localhost)
*   **The Key:** `service_account.json` (The Ignition)
*   **The Driver:** `gargenterprises2019@gmail.com` (Verified via Google Auth)

## 2. Changes Implemented

### Frontend ([index.html](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tools/marketing-dashboard/index.html))
*   Added **Google Sign-In** button.
*   Implemented [login()](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tools/marketing-dashboard/index.html#249-253) / [logout()](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tools/marketing-dashboard/index.html#254-257) flows.
*   **Security:** Frontend now grabs a Firebase ID Token and sends it with every API request (`Authorization: Bearer <token>`).

### Backend ([server.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/nucleus/mcp_server/server.py))
*   Added [verify_token()](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tools/marketing-dashboard/server.py#81-99) middleware.
*   Initializes `firebase_admin` with the secret Service Account.
*   **Enforcement:** Blocks any request to `/api/ingest` that doesn't have a valid signature from the CEO.

